  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/01-hook.wav",
      "sec": 3.257,
      "text": "最愛囤幣的 Strategy，開始賣幣付股息了。",
      "hash": "bcd95e2a401c",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "not-a-seller",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/02-not-a-seller.wav",
      "sec": 4.979,
      "text": "二零二二年它說，我們不是賣家，今年五月起卻開始賣。",
      "hash": "8214dcbf63bf",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "amplified",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/03-amplified.wav",
      "sec": 5.54,
      "text": "很多人把它當比特幣放大版，十一月五號幣跌六趴，它跌一成。",
      "hash": "d7080674cb4f",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "holdings",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/04-holdings.wav",
      "sec": 4.349,
      "text": "它從二零二零年一路買，現在囤了全球四趴的比特幣。",
      "hash": "ff539c1701a3",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "flywheel",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/05-flywheel.wav",
      "sec": 5.084,
      "text": "祕訣是溢價，股票比背後的幣還貴，就發新股去買幣。",
      "hash": "4d54b4aa91fa",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "premium-math",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/06-premium-math.wav",
      "sec": 4.918,
      "text": "溢價兩倍時，發十股能買二十枚，每股含幣反而變多。",
      "hash": "02e48f974439",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "buy-the-top",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/07-buy-the-top.wav",
      "sec": 4.256,
      "text": "共同創辦人 Saylor 說要永遠買在頂部，但這有個前提。",
      "hash": "41cf1782c398",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "premium-gone",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/08-premium-gone.wav",
      "sec": 5.405,
      "text": "到了二零二六年，溢價幾乎歸零，股價差不多只等於手上的幣。",
      "hash": "b509d88efa5a",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "yield-negative",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/09-yield-negative.wav",
      "sec": 5.923,
      "text": "幣多了二十六趴，股數卻多了三十一趴，每股含幣反而少三點七趴。",
      "hash": "0d7408c5abd2",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "selling-for-dividends",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/10-selling-for-dividends.wav",
      "sec": 4.961,
      "text": "它已賣掉約四點三億美元的幣，拿去付優先股股息和回購。",
      "hash": "4f2b86a9f3f8",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "watch-next",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/11-watch-next.wav",
      "sec": 5.336,
      "text": "接下來看兩件事，幣價貼著成本線，指數去留還沒定。",
      "hash": "35cca7846562",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "your-call",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/12-your-call.wav",
      "sec": 3.873,
      "text": "你覺得，它該不該賣幣來付股息？留言說說看。",
      "hash": "37cf66fba8f7",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "file": "audio/mstr-bitcoin-v2/13-end.wav",
      "sec": 2.519,
      "text": "白話國際，一支講透一件事。",
      "hash": "fd399c50fd4e",
      "voice": "Iapetus",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts"
    }
  ]
}